From aa0075ec16ee9e45ce0d9596dc874dca8ca0f990 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:16:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: Add host-side Molmo2 image preprocessing

Port the HF Molmo2 processor (overlapping crop tiling, bilinear resize,
patchify, 2x2 pooling indices, image token layout, BOS insertion) so the
runner works from the chat-template prompt and the decoded image. The
HF sidecar input remains available as preprocess=sidecar, and
preprocess=cpp_verify compares both paths.

